Sword, cloak, and body armor, may serve as replacement after "unlucky"
incidents (disintegration, disintegration by magic, maybe BoH explosion,
self polymorph, whatever) before doing the final run. Water walking in
addition to be able to pass the water levels in case the game was stingy
and the wand of wishing used up or lost.

The key might avoid waking Vlad from kicking the doors open, but I'm not
sure that he'll interrupt his meditation; deep down in Gehennom I usually
have some key, so I never checked that.

The most interesting "junk" is the non-predetermined loot in those many
chests, anyway. IMO.

